│ patch_name               │ archive_confirmed_reheating                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Require declining re-scored archive fitness to confirm reheating. A falling batch mean    │
│                          │ can result from overly broad mutations even while the archive remains strong; increasing  │
│                          │ sigma then can amplify the decline. Store smoothed archive fitness in the fourth memory   │
│                          │ slot, retaining its initialization role through a 1.0 offset. This preserves reheating    │
│                          │ when both population and archive performance deteriorate, using feedback without assuming │
│                          │ a task-switch schedule.                                                                   │
